decide to stay open.

5c5648e3-0229-4967-a9ee-1f616afdae92-0
00:35:33.600 --> 00:35:38.360
Was yeah, 25 to 70 was shown as the doses.

3738d822-e556-4c97-b992-baf222667f1a-0
00:35:38.360 --> 00:35:43.798
However,
Garcia and Romo had found that weight

3738d822-e556-4c97-b992-baf222667f1a-1
00:35:43.798 --> 00:35:48.080
adjusted and fixed dosing approaches.

cee8ac62-b04d-4449-b4bf-596c2d7d2ddf-0
00:35:48.160 --> 00:35:53.835
Generally a fixed dose applies the same
amount of clinical response regardless of

cee8ac62-b04d-4449-b4bf-596c2d7d2ddf-1
00:35:53.835 --> 00:35:54.320
weight.

f70d5fa3-aec4-4999-a3c3-6653d532751a-0
00:35:54.800 --> 00:35:58.916
And so in that in keeping with that meta
analysis,

f70d5fa3-aec4-4999-a3c3-6653d532751a-1
00:35:58.916 --> 00:36:05.454
we went with the dose response threshold
mirroring the major depressive disorder

f70d5fa3-aec4-4999-a3c3-6653d532751a-2
00:36:05.454 --> 00:36:08.280
and post traumatic stress disorder.

b7737cca-d656-46df-ad23-9c385161c810-0
00:36:08.760 --> 00:36:14.186
When we found the average,
when I found that the average weight of a

b7737cca-d656-46df-ad23-9c385161c810-1
00:36:14.186 --> 00:36:20.636
person multiplied out by the same weight
ends up being around 25 to 30 milligrams

b7737cca-d656-46df-ad23-9c385161c810-2
00:36:20.636 --> 00:36:22.760
for substance use disorder.

d10818db-1cb7-4a72-bea3-5cfdcaab5677-0
00:36:23.160 --> 00:36:29.285
Typically what we found or what was
available in alcohol use disorder and

d10818db-1cb7-4a72-bea3-5cfdcaab5677-1
00:36:29.285 --> 00:36:34.832
tobacco use disorder was that they used a
high dose from 25 to 30,

d10818db-1cb7-4a72-bea3-5cfdcaab5677-2
00:36:34.832 --> 00:36:38.640
worked on the integration process after
that.

5a8f9ce1-b280-4d40-abd6-b667f933979f-0
00:36:38.880 --> 00:36:44.582
And then once they had gone through that,
if they needed additional dosing,

5a8f9ce1-b280-4d40-abd6-b667f933979f-1
00:36:44.582 --> 00:36:50.734
they often increase the dose versus PTSD
where they started with a lower dose and

5a8f9ce1-b280-4d40-abd6-b667f933979f-2
00:36:50.734 --> 00:36:52.760
then went to a higher dose.

9d987231-9838-456a-8a76-7ae63d7c0901-0
00:36:52.760 --> 00:36:56.830
They started with that higher dose and
then went to an even higher if we needed

9d987231-9838-456a-8a76-7ae63d7c0901-1
00:36:56.830 --> 00:36:59.680
to disrupt that default mode network a
little bit more.

32cf4cb2-c2b7-45f9-aea5-3da35e66cd4c-0
00:37:00.960 --> 00:37:03.863
Again,
integration is incredibly important in

32cf4cb2-c2b7-45f9-aea5-3da35e66cd4c-1
00:37:03.863 --> 00:37:07.146
