87131e4b-591c-4a54-9a82-243eeba69600-0
00:38:07.440 --> 00:38:11.861
So treatment resistant depression,
you're going to notice that this one

87131e4b-591c-4a54-9a82-243eeba69600-1
00:38:11.861 --> 00:38:13.520
looks very similar to PTSD.

11dc73ae-25c6-4797-9ebc-1df722f218d9-0
00:38:14.640 --> 00:38:19.445
It is Goodwin and all showed that a
single fixed dose of 25 milligrams of

11dc73ae-25c6-4797-9ebc-1df722f218d9-1
00:38:19.445 --> 00:38:24.316
psilocybin equivalent is the evidence
based therapeutic dose for treatment

11dc73ae-25c6-4797-9ebc-1df722f218d9-2
00:38:24.316 --> 00:38:25.680
resistant depression.

583623f3-9698-437a-aeca-fbf476882862-0
00:38:28.160 --> 00:38:33.167
It showed that typically what we do in
order to avoid dissociation or

583623f3-9698-437a-aeca-fbf476882862-1
00:38:33.167 --> 00:38:37.960
amplification of suicidality is an
introductory or a safety probe.

a37e8963-712d-4080-8ea6-c889829b7095-0
00:38:38.360 --> 00:38:46.160
Notice that same mechanism from the PTSD
in open label feasibility trials.

59dbee83-bb1b-4791-a78c-8f8c5a18687b-0
00:38:46.840 --> 00:38:51.166
It was used to evaluate individual
physiological reactivity and ease

59dbee83-bb1b-4791-a78c-8f8c5a18687b-1
00:38:51.166 --> 00:38:56.183
treatment resistant patients into altered
States and mitigate that anticipatory

59dbee83-bb1b-4791-a78c-8f8c5a18687b-2
00:38:56.183 --> 00:38:56.560
panic.

b3aadfcd-c5cd-475f-917a-748a59e6c54c-0
00:38:57.960 --> 00:39:03.110
